### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@dockerUrl = http://product-service:8082
@contentType = application/json

### ─── READ ALL PRODUCTS ───
### Returns Laptop Pro, Wireless Mouse, USB-C Hub
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ PRODUCT BY ID ───
### Fetch product 1 (Laptop Pro, $1299.99, stock 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ PRODUCT BY ID ───
### Fetch product 2 (Wireless Mouse, $29.99, stock 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/2
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── CREATE NEW PRODUCT ───
### Adds a new product to catalog
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "RGB backlit mechanical keyboard with blue switches",
  "price": 89.99,
  "stockQuantity": 75,
  "category": "Accessories"
}

### ─── UPDATE STOCK ───
### Decrement Laptop Pro stock from 50 → 45 (simulating a sale)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quantity": 45
}

### ─── UPDATE STOCK (invalid product) ───
### Should return 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999/stock
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "quantity": 10
}

### ─── MCP TOOL DISCOVERY (SSE) ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp/sse
Accept: text/event-stream

### ─── HEALTH CHECK ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: {{contentType}}